{"seq":2,"slug":"penetration-ricochet","title":"穿透与跳弹：命中之后的物理分支","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-projectile-ballistics/collision/penetration-ricochet","wordCount":1455,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"穿透与跳弹-命中之后的物理分支\">穿透与跳弹：命中之后的物理分支</h1><p>一颗子弹撞上木板、钢板还是敌人的头盔，结果天差地别：可能停下、可能钻过去还打中身后的人、也可能斜着弹开击中意料之外的目标。《战地》系列的穿墙击杀、《军团要塞》狙击弹的贯穿、各种「弹墙手雷」，都建立在命中后的物理分支之上。前一篇<a href=\"projectile-collision\">投射物碰撞</a>负责检测出「撞到了什么、在哪、法线朝哪」，这篇接手：拿到这个命中信息后，决定投射物停止、穿透还是跳弹，以及各自的物理计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-命中响应的决策分支\">核心概念：命中响应的决策分支</h2><p>每次 CCD 报告命中，投射物都要走一遍决策：先看命中材质允不允许穿透、能量够不够；再看入射角是否浅到该跳弹；否则就停下结算。这个分支是命中章的核心逻辑：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[CCD 命中: 点/法线/材质] --&gt; B{材质可穿透&lt;br/&gt;且剩余能量足?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[穿透: 扣能量+降伤&lt;br/&gt;继续飞行]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{入射角 &lt; 跳弹阈值&lt;br/&gt;且材质可跳弹?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[跳弹: 反射速度&lt;br/&gt;继续飞行]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[停止: 结算伤害&lt;br/&gt;见伤害衰减]&#10;    C --&gt; G[回到飞行状态]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; H[触发命中特效/销毁]\">flowchart TD\n    A[CCD 命中: 点/法线/材质] --&gt; B{材质可穿透&lt;br/&gt;且剩余能量足?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[穿透: 扣能量+降伤&lt;br/&gt;继续飞行]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{入射角 &lt; 跳弹阈值&lt;br/&gt;且材质可跳弹?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[跳弹: 反射速度&lt;br/&gt;继续飞行]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[停止: 结算伤害&lt;br/&gt;见伤害衰减]\n    C --&gt; G[回到飞行状态]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; H[触发命中特效/销毁]</pre><p>穿透和跳弹都让投射物回到飞行状态、可能再次命中，这正是<a href=\"../foundations/projectile-model\">数据模型</a>里生命周期状态机在「飞行」与「命中判定」之间反复迁移的原因。为防止无限反弹或穿透，通常给每颗弹设「最大穿透次数 / 反弹次数」上限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"穿透-能量损耗模型\">穿透：能量损耗模型</h2><p>穿透（penetration）让子弹钻过可穿材质，代价是损失速度与伤害。物理上，穿透消耗的能量取决于材质厚度与硬度。工程上不必精确求解，用一个基于材质的能量/伤害衰减就够：</p>\n<p>设剩余穿透力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，穿过厚度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>、硬度系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 的材质后：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>P</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>伤害倍率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>P</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P&#x27; = P - k\\,d, \\qquad \\text{伤害倍率} = \\frac{P&#x27;}{P_0}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">伤害倍率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2649em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4289em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>P</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降到零或负，子弹停在材质里，不再穿出。落到实现，每种材质配一个「穿透消耗」，子弹配一个「初始穿透力」。木板消耗小、混凝土消耗大、钢板直接挡住。穿出后的子弹伤害按剩余穿透力比例衰减——所以隔着薄墙击杀伤害更低，隔着厚墙可能只剩擦伤或干脆打不穿。</p>\n<p>穿透的一个实现要点是<strong>沿路径继续检测</strong>：子弹从入射点钻进材质，要在出射侧算出穿出点，再从那里继续 CCD 找下一个目标。对薄目标（人体、木板）常简化为「命中即穿、扣一次能量、从命中点稍后继续」；对厚实体才认真算入射/出射两点。穿甲弹能连续贯穿一排敌人，就是每穿一个扣一次能量、降一次伤，直到能量耗尽。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跳弹-反射向量与入射角\">跳弹：反射向量与入射角</h2><p>跳弹（ricochet）是子弹以浅角度撞上硬表面时被弹开。判断是否跳弹的关键是<strong>入射角</strong>——子弹速度方向与表面的夹角。角度越浅（越接近擦过），越容易跳弹；垂直撞击则不会。</p>\n<p>用命中法线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 可以同时判断和计算。入射方向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与法线的夹角决定跳不跳，反射向量则是标准的镜面反射公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{v}_{reflect} = \\vec{v} - 2(\\vec{v}\\cdot\\hat{n})\\,\\hat{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0001em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7973em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个公式把速度中「撞向表面」的分量翻转，保留「平行表面」的分量。实际游戏里还要乘一个<strong>能量保留系数</strong>（跳弹后变慢）并加点随机扰动（让跳弹方向不完全确定，更真实也更难被利用）。是否跳弹的判据常写成：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\vec{v}\\cdot\\hat{n}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 相对速度大小很小（即入射角浅）时跳弹，反之停止。</p>\n<p>跳弹的能量与伤害同样衰减，且通常每次跳弹后伤害大幅下降，避免「一发弹墙清屋」的失衡。有些游戏把跳弹做成主动玩法（弹墙绕过掩体），就会调高跳弹保留系数、放宽角度阈值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"材质系统-把分支数据化\">材质系统：把分支数据化</h2><p>穿透和跳弹的所有参数都不该硬编码，而应挂在<strong>表面材质</strong>上，与<a href=\"../../game-data-driven-design/foundations/why-data-driven\">数据驱动设计</a>一脉相承。一张材质表大致长这样：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>材质</th>\n<th>可穿透</th>\n<th>穿透消耗</th>\n<th>可跳弹</th>\n<th>跳弹角阈值</th>\n<th>命中特效</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>肉体</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>血液</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>木板</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>木屑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混凝土</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>20°</td>\n<td>灰尘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钢板</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>30°</td>\n<td>火花</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>玻璃</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>碎裂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>命中时用碰撞返回的表面类型查表，同一套穿透/跳弹代码就能对不同材质产生不同行为，策划也能独立调整而不碰逻辑。命中特效的选择还要与<a href=\"../../game-vfx-particle-systems/vfx-craft/vfx-types-anatomy\">特效系统</a>对接——不同材质溅不同的火花、灰尘、血液，是命中反馈可读性的重要一环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>每次命中走「可穿透？→ 可跳弹？→ 停止」的决策分支，穿透与跳弹都让投射物回到飞行态，需设最大次数上限防无限反弹。</li>\n<li>穿透用能量损耗模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>P</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P&#x27;=P-kd</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>，穿出后伤害按剩余穿透力比例衰减；薄目标简化为「命中即穿扣一次」，穿甲弹据此连续贯穿。</li>\n<li>跳弹由入射角判定、用镜面反射公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec v-2(\\vec v\\cdot\\hat n)\\hat n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7973em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 算反射方向，叠加能量保留系数与随机扰动；每次跳弹伤害大幅下降防失衡。</li>\n<li>穿透与跳弹的全部参数应挂在表面材质表上，数据驱动地让同一套代码对不同材质产生不同行为，并驱动对应命中特效。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"projectile-collision\">投射物碰撞</a> —— 提供本篇所需的命中点、法线与材质。</li>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"damage-falloff\">伤害衰减</a> —— 穿透/跳弹后的剩余伤害如何最终结算到目标。</li>\n<li>基础章：<a href=\"../foundations/projectile-model\">数据模型</a> —— 穿透与跳弹对应生命周期状态机的循环迁移。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../game-vfx-particle-systems/vfx-craft/vfx-types-anatomy\">特效与粒子系统 · VFX 类型解剖</a> —— 不同材质命中特效的表现层。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"穿透与跳弹：命中之后的物理分支","id":"穿透与跳弹-命中之后的物理分支"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：命中响应的决策分支","id":"核心概念-命中响应的决策分支"},{"level":2,"text":"穿透：能量损耗模型","id":"穿透-能量损耗模型"},{"level":2,"text":"跳弹：反射向量与入射角","id":"跳弹-反射向量与入射角"},{"level":2,"text":"材质系统：把分支数据化","id":"材质系统-把分支数据化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"投射物碰撞：连续检测与穿墙的隐蔽 bug","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-projectile-ballistics/collision/projectile-collision"},"next":{"title":"伤害衰减：从一次命中到具体数值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-projectile-ballistics/collision/damage-falloff"}}